{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>法國示威｜當局嚴陣以待周末示威　警方分析社媒影片拘捕搶掠商店的人</strong></p><p>法國周末或有示威<br>當局嚴陣以待<br>警方分析社媒影片<br>拘捕搶掠商店疑犯</p><p>暫時未能從Now 國際擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.now.com/home/international/player?newsId=666639\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.325966+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:24:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.638875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.638875+00:00","content_hash":"582d0d89589b3c4440d6028178199b4715071591de7dd73d7285bb8d397103c6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}